// A branch on a secret. riinac accepts it, raises the security level of the
// branches and labels the result Rahsia; the Coq core's T_If requires a plain
// Benar, so this program is outside the proofs. A KNOWN soundness discrepancy
// (REQ-111), listed in conformance::KNOWN_SOUNDNESS_DISCREPANCIES until the
// owner decides.
fungsi utama() -> () kesan Bersih {
    biar hasil = kalau sulit betul { 1 } lain { 2 };
    ()
}
